` and `generateContent`, within `DataContext.tsx`. I am ensuring `mintNFT`'s parameters, like name and imageUrl, are compliant and that any state updates adhere to expected types. I'll confirm that the `cryptoAssets` are correctly typed as `CryptoAsset[]`.\n\n\n**Validating State Structures**\n\nI'm now validating state structures in `DataContext.tsx`, focusing on `impactInvestments`, `budgets`, and `gamification`. I'm confirming `impactData` and `customBackgroundUrl` are correctly typed and follow guidelines. I'm checking `addTransaction`, `activeIllusion`, and account linking and focusing on `pitchBusinessPlan` too.\n\n\n",
