tsx`. Finally, I'll update `vite.config.ts` to solve the Coinbase Smart Wallet issue.\n\n\n**Refining Key Initialization**\n\nI'm now focusing on initializing `GoogleGenAI` and addressing the direct use of `process.env.API_KEY`. I'll stick to the specified rule, ensuring the environment key is used. I am working on how to handle the error in the case that the env var is not present. I'm also creating an XML now. I will continue to remove setTimeout calls and UI elements that allow modification of the Project ID. I'm updating `Web3Provider.tsx`, `DataContext.tsx`, `AIAdvisorView.tsx`, `CryptoView.tsx`, and `index.tsx`, as described. I'm prioritizing broadcasting a real transaction.\n\n\n",
